  "post_content": "<p>El CD Onda &quot;B&quot; ha vuelto a golear y ha ganado esta tarde al Alfondeguilla CF por 4-1, en el partido celebrado en el campo municipal L&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic de 2&ordf; categor&iacute;a regional de f&uacute;tbol, cuyo grupo 3&ordm; encabeza.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/02/IMG_8962.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La primera parte ha finalizado 2-1, despu&eacute;s de que marcar&aacute;n Miguel y Castillo por los locales. En la segunda mitad, el D Onda &quot;B&quot; ha seguido dominando y han conseguido los otros dos goles Pastor y Abel.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8962.jpg\" alt=\"img_8962\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8964.jpg\" alt=\"img_8964\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8965.jpg\" alt=\"img_8965\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8966.jpg\" alt=\"img_8966\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8967.jpg\" alt=\"img_8967\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8968.jpg\" alt=\"img_8968\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8969.jpg\" alt=\"img_8969\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8970.jpg\" alt=\"img_8970\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8971.jpg\" alt=\"img_8971\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8972.jpg\" alt=\"img_8972\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondaalfondeguillacf/img_8973.jpg\" alt=\"img_8973\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
